    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Girlfriend Who Likes to Watch Football",
      "",
      "Li Hua thought his girlfriend was a bit weird.",
      "Before, she was always very unhappy when he watched football.",
      "However, she recently started to watch the European Championship with Li Hua.",
      "One night at 3 o’clock she got up and watched the game between Germany and Ukraine.",
      "What’s more, she prepared beer and chips!",
      "Although she still didn’t know what a penalty, corner or red card meant, Li Hua was very happy.",
      "He therefore planned to teach his girlfriend some football knowledge, ..",
      ".. since it would enable them to watch and talk about the games.",
      "",
      "The next day Li Hua opened WeChat and saw his girlfriend’s moments:",
      "“Top 5 handsome football players on the German team”,",
      "“Mr. McDreamy, a guidebook for watching handsome football players in the European Championship”,",
      "“Top 10 handsome players on Italian teams throughout history”,",
